          "description": "An upper semicircle contains a circle tangent to the diameter at its midpoint and to the semicircular arc at its highest point. Decorative orange fill omitted.",
          "mathematics": "Outer radius R; inner radius R/2. Both tangencies and the complete diameter are preserved; no dimensions are printed.",
